{"version":1,"content":"<p><strong>The Nuclear Company 宣佈 Prosperity One 計劃，擬於肯塔基州劉易斯縣建設 6.6 吉瓦核電園區</strong></p><p>・核電園區選址肯塔基<br>・劉易斯縣擬建核能項目<br>・項目規模達6.6吉瓦</p><p>暫時未能從am730擷取全文。</p><p><a href=\"https://www.am730.com.hk/column/商業動向/2011879/the-nuclear-company-宣佈-prosperity-one-計劃-擬於肯塔基州劉易斯縣建設-6.6-吉瓦核電園區\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">閱讀原文</a></p>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T18:01:46.631917+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":120,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"minimal","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T14:51:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T18:47:33.363960+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T17:58:04.794346+00:00","content_hash":"dc1e66a8959a58dded5a4ef35e47c1bbb2a5084643b75ecae784369bde0b747d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}